WEBVTT

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.050
Geez.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:11.550
Why do I end up with so much stuff when I go shopping alone?

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.590
Why? Why?

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.740
It’s heavy.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.900
I can’t hold…

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.190
This is what happens when they make me do everything.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.480
Right, Masha?
Don’t you think so too?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.690
Don’t you think so? Don’t you think so?

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.590
Do you understand what I’m saying?

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.930
How nice…

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.290
They’re going to make me work even if I go back, so it’s okay to take a break now, right?

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.000
Right? Right?

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.810
I now understand how it feels
to run a business.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:00.190
This park is so… won-der-ful.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.860
The wind…

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:08.990
feels so good.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.160
Thank you.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.430
Thank you over here.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:19.330
Oh? A child’s performing?

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:22.040
I wonder if she’s
an elementary student.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.540
Hello!

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:24.830
You scared me.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.040
I’ll perform an act, so watch.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.690
Um… I…

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:30.820
Now then…

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:37.470
Gather around and come watch.

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:39.000
I’ll start by riding this ball.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.450
I’ll rotate plates now.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.330
A plucky act now!

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.230
Wow.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:50.040
This is…

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.360
Fire!

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.030
Awesome!

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.610
I’m rotating this even more today!

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:57.700
More!!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.120
It’s wiggling…

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.740
BOOM!

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:02.470
GO!

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:05.910
How was it?

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.170
It was amazing!

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.250
Really?

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.920
Yep, yep!

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.340
Now then…

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.450
Then please give me a tip.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.280
Tip tip tip tip…

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.280
I can’t really…

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.530
Tip tip tip tip…

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.060
Thank you.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:26.750
Bye.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:33.380
Wait!..

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:33.380
Sorry, I have money troubles as well…

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:40.470
I did that with all my heart…

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.950
Bu-Ling’s act was bad.
Only if Bu-Ling did it better…

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:47.090
You don’t need to get that depressed…

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.000
Then…

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.650
I’ll show you my best trick!!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:53.980
A shark will come out of
this silk hat… byuuu!

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:05.140
Oh, you should’ve said something if you can perform an act, too.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:08.540
Those ears and tail are well-made.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.780
How does this thing work?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.460
Huh? I can’t take it off…

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:17.760
It’s warm! Are these?..

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:22.100
We will now end our performance for today!

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.830
Goodbye now!

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.300
There’s a reason for this!

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.630
Please, don’t shout.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:37.880
Hm hm!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.050
Do you understand?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.110
Hm hm!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.260
Really?

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:42.260
Hrm hrm!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.140
For real?

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.190
Hrm hrm!!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.620
They’re REAL!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.610
The ears are real!

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:54.400
It’s a cat’s! It’s a cat’s!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.960
That’s so cool! Bu-Ling wants ears like those, too!

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.110
So please make me your pupil!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:02.910
Huh?

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:05.410
Is it okay? Wee, so happy!!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.330
Now then, let’s start the tough training that leads to glory!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:11.790
Ears ears ears ears…

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.830
Hello?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.170
So what should I do?

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:19.610
Bunny hopping? Bungee jumping?

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.390
I can’t really teach…

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.680
Now, what do I do? What do I do?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.560
Um…

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.910
…um do 10 laps around the park while rinding a ball!

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:33.310
That’s an easy task.
I’ll do it right away.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:36.710
Zoom!

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.120
She’s gone.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.580
Then…

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.340
Good bye!

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:50.840
Quiche.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.130
Where are you, Quiche?

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:54.760
Here.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.550
…Master Deep Blue, I’m here.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:03.440
Report the result of the Chimera Anima fusion with a human.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.520
Yes!

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:09.020
After analyzing the data of the battle of the prototype…

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:12.780
it has many unstable elements so far.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.900
But there is no problem.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:17.950
Which means?..

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:19.730
Yes,

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:23.240
I have begun searching
for a compatible match.

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:27.580
I will defeat them using it’s power.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.830
Phewww…

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.630
I hope I’m safe now.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.150
Ichigo-san!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.680
Um, what’s the matter, Retasu?

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.300
I came to look for you, Ichigo-san.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:47.240
Huh, why?

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:51.060
Shirogane-san told me to look for you since you were late.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.180
Shirogane said that?

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.000
Yes.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.430
I see!

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:57.250
So Shirogane made you look for me –

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:01.770
Mew Mew Café’s #1 waitress,
since he got worried?

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:02.820
Nope…

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.660
He said that you were probably ditching work so bring her back.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.160
By the way, Ichigo-san,

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.700
…where have you been?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:16.140
At the park… wait, I wasn’t ditching work. Someone was holding me back.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.640
Holding you back?

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:22.820
Yeah, some girl starting to perform some acts and asked for a tip.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.760
It was annoying.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.840
Was that girl…

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.820
…small, yellow, and looks really cheerful?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.850
What?

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.270
How do you know, Retasu?

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.080
Because… over there.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:36.920
What did you say?

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:41.110
I found you!

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:44.460
You said that you would make Bu-Ling your pupil! Why did you run away from me?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.460
In-in a situation like this…

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:54.140
IT’S A FLYING HUGE RADISH!

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.100
Really???

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.710
It’s just a normal radish…

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.210
It’s not a huge radish.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.590
Retasu, take this!

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.550
Ichigo-san?!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:08.570
Wait up!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.410
Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.410
No! No! No! No!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.850
…Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:16.620
Don’t follow me!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.910
I won’t let you get away!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:26.860
How persistent…

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:27.550
I found you!

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.030
Cut it out!

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.380
No, I won’t!

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.300
Wait up!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.180
GEEeeeezzz!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.050
I can’t go on anymore…

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.130
Huh? My handkerchief is…

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.780
Are you looking for this?

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.510
That’s mine! Give it back!

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:55.310
Here.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:56.280
Give it! Give it!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.560
Give it! Give it!

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.520
Give!!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.440
Give it!

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:06.450
If you want it back,
tell me how to get cat ears.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.430
Who are you?
Where are you from?

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.740
That is…

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:19.040
Bu-Ling… just a normal elementary student.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:19.930
You’re not normal!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:23.710
You want cat ears that bad? To make money out of it?

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.050
A normal elementary student
won’t do that!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.570
Can’t you tell that I’m annoyed?!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:42.290
Do you think I have these because I want them? Give me a break!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.620
Got it?!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.540
Don’t follow me anymore.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.300
Wait… big sister…

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:48.800
Don’t follow me!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.800
Geez, I wasted so much time.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:01.100
Everyone must be mad now.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:12.480
I told you not to… follow… me…

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.110
I’m back!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.610
Ichigo-san.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.570
Sorry about that, Retasu.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:23.580
What happened to that
small yellow girl?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.960
I got rid of her.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.580
You sure took your time…

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.040
I heard…

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.440
A child saw your cat ears, right?

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.300
You were careless.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.590
She’s not normal,
so it wasn’t my fault.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.880
She kept asking how to get cat ears,

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.300
…she would do anything for her performance.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:43.940
There must be some circumstance for a small child to do that.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:49.770
Is something wrong?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.070
No, it’s… nothing.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.660
This one’s not good enough too.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:07.830
I need a more pure Spirit or I can’t create the ultimate Chimera Anima.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.620
Oh well.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.830
I’m going to borrow this.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.250
Good morning, Ichigo.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.550
What’s wrong?
Why do you look so gloomy?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:19.760
Somehow I feel really blue today.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.550
Oh, it’s not about Aoyama-kun though.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:27.270
It’s true that I don’t see him lately,

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.190
but I think he’s starting
to take interest in me.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:36.650
But… if we both like each other,
all the girls in the school will hate me.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.700
What should I?..

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:43.040
Wait, that’s not what I’m worried about. Listen…

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.280
Morning!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.250
..Go.. mor..ng

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.250
What should I listen to?

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:55.670
Oh? Something like that happened…

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.220
Momomiya-san…

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.600
Do you regret it?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.300
Then you should know what to do.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:06.060
What?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:11.460
I think you only need to be honest with your current feeling.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.230
Aoyama-kun…

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:16.050
Don’t worry.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.740
I’m sure the other person… will understand your feeling if you mean it.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.780
Yep, that’s the spirit!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:32.540
Why do I get remedial lessons
on a day like this?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.680
…that hurts.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.980
Why aren’t cat ears growing?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.860
But I’m not going to lose just yet!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.190
<i>Do you think I have these
because I want them?</i>

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.450
Why?

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.940
Cat ears are cool.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.190
Hey!..

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:02.410
So you want to become a cat?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.120
Wh-Who are you?!

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:07.790
I am…

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.030
an angel.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:09.910
That’s a lie!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.580
An angel doesn’t have an evil face like that!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.000
How rude.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.790
To think I fell from the clouds to make your wish come true…

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:22.010
Oh wait, I think you call those
“Fallen angels”.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:25.220
Go away! Bu-Ling doesn’t want
to talk to you!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.930
I can’t do that!

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.310
I have business with you.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:33.190
I’ll make your dream come true.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:38.360
I wonder if that girl’s here.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.740
There she is!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:42.780
Alien!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.740
Quiche!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.450
Hurry up and spill your Spirit out!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.950
Ichigo, transform!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:55.050
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:41.130
Heh, this is the best Spirit
I’ve seen so far.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.760
Stop right there!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.430
Huh?

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.440
Quiche, what are you trying to do a harmless child?

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:59.140
I won’t let such a thing pass by!

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:01.900
I’ll serve for the Earth’s future ~Nya!!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.070
It’s the cat-ear oneechan!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.280
Oh, so you came to see me
this time, Honey?

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.860
I didn’t want to see you!

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:10.660
Well,

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.710
I can play with you anytime I want.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.080
Give me that girl.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:15.540
No!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:19.420
Only a few Spirits
can become a Chimera Anima.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.500
Especially the ones that are pure!

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.340
As I thought oneechan is really amazing!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.220
Be quiet!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.060
I won’t let you get away!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.770
Oneechan in-front!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:37.730
Minto! Retasu!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.860
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.860
Ouch!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.780
That was fun! One more time!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.070
I CAN’T!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.370
Are you okay?

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.240
I hit my butt.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.700
Stop complaining.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.000
Oh my…

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:59.830
So you all are here now.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:05.090
In that case I’ll give up on her Spirit and use the one I found yesterday.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.470
FUSION!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.350
S-a-m-b-a!..

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.680
Samba, samba, samba, samba…

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.060
What is that?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.150
A lizard?

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.850
I HATE LIZARDS!!

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.320
Let’s go.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.150
Retasu, take care of her.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:27.650
Yes.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.650
Wait! Oneechan!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:37.780
You!..

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.040
StrawberBell!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:43.380
Samba!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.510
MintonArrow!!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:54.640
Minto!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.800
It’s dangerous, stay here!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:56.600
Wait!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.100
Samba!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.690
Oneechan!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.900
No, you can’t go.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:17.530
Samba samba…
Next is charring samba.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.120
SAMBA!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.040
No!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.920
…samba?

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.350
What’s this stone?

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.380
Is this heaven?

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:38.020
Bu-Ling, your ears…

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:43.320
Wuaaaahhhh!! I have ears!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:49.480
I did it! I have cat ears, too!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.690
Those aren’t cat ears.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.320
Yeah, I think those aren’t cat ears.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.790
Really?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:16:59.490
Masha!?

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.290
Is she… the 4th one?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.090
Mew Pudding!

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:15.720
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.890
I see.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.970
What an interesting kitten.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.300
I’m not a kitten, I’m a small monkey!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.180
Shut up!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.640
Samba, crush her first!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.100
Samba!!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:04.810
It’s coming again!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.350
I can feel the power inside me.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.980
Please leave it to Bu-Ling!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.270
Those aren’t going to hit me.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.610
I’m here!

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:21.710
PuddingRings!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.840
I’m going on the offensive now.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:39.180
Reborn… PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.350
Mew Strawberry!

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:46.810
Okay!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:06.790
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.510
Sambaaaaa…

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.710
You did it!

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:19.670
Alright!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.140
Nice.

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:28.110
I was pretty confident with today’s Chimera Anima you know.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:29.890
Oh well…

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.100
I’ll come again!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.600
Don’t ever come again!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:35.610
Retrieve!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.740
Masha, can you return that Spirit to the original person?

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.660
Leave it to me! Leave it to me!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.210
I’ll give this back to you.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:57.550
This is how Puddding became part of our team and Café Mew Mew.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.050
I’m happy!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:05.510
This time, my workload should get less now…

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.140
I’m going to ride a ball!

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:10.110
I’m going to spin it more than usual!

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:15.440
I guess it won’t.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.110
I’m going to breathe fire!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.700
Bu-Ling, cut it out!

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:21.990
Tip please!?

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.330
Yeah! Hot spring! Hot spring!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.260
Once my skin becomes smooth and beautiful,

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:32.790
Aoyama-kun and I might fall in love together.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:36.580
Your skin might smooth at a hot spring, but it doesn’t mean you’ll become beautiful.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.090
I’m not going to lose to your teasing, Minto.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:44.020
Oh my, what a face. It would be a miracle if that gets curled at a hot spring.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.220
Next time: To the Hot Spring!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:49.260
The Mysterious Mountain’s Miracle of Love.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:52.180
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
